# Density-fitted multicomponent SCF in the default automatic auxiliary
# basis, formed from the union of the electronic and protonic basis sets
# on each center. The electronic basis is triple-zeta, which the union
# needs to be accurate: the energy agrees with Cholesky to 1e-7 Eh. The
# dump's self-consistency check exercises the shared fitting basis.
System H2O.xyz
Basis cc-pVTZ
ProtonBasis PB4-D
QuantumProtons 2
Method HF
JKMethod RI
SaveChk neo_ri.chk
NEODump neo_ri.h5
NEODumpVerify true
